  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ocean Assistance in the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment includes activities to support Pacific partners maintain ocean health, advocate for Pacific ocean issues, and respond to ocean litter and waste.
The Pacific Ocean Litter Program (POLP) is delivered by the Secretariat of the Pacific Regional Environment Programme (SPREP) and helps deliver the Pacific Marine Litter Action Plan (2018-2025). 
The PACPLAN Resilience Project is delivered by SPREP and supports the Pacific regional response in the event of oil spills. 
Funding for the Office of the Pacific Ocean Commissioner supports Pacific ocean governance, advocacy and coordination. 
ReefCloud utilises AI to supports communities and local governments to improve management of their coral reefs.</narrative>
  </description>
